    <section id="about" class="wow no-margin padding-50px-bottom homebg1 fadeIn">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="row text-center">
          <div class="col-md-9 center-col col-sm-12 col-xs-12">
            <img alt="excentia tatva dehradun" class="margin-10px-bottom" src="images/logo.png">
                          <span class="letter-spacing-5 text-white display-block alt-font text-uppercase margin-20px-bottom">First Gold Rated Uber Luxury Green 3/4 BHK Residences
</span>    

          </div>
        </div>
          
          
		
        		
          <div class="row text-center margin-50px-bottom">
			   <p class="large padding-20px-lr text-white">Dehradun’s first state-of-the-art, ultra-luxury homes are nestled in the lap of nature on the prestigious Rajpur Road, the crown jewel of Dehradun. This ultra low-density project features just 307 units across 5 acres, offering an unparalleled sense of exclusivity. As Dehradun's first-ever gold-rated green residential building, it seamlessly combines opulence with eco-conscious living. Situated in a low AQI zone, the development ensures the air you breathe is as pristine as nature intended.</p>

              <p class="large padding-20px-lr text-white">All apartments are designed with innovative biophilic architecture, providing ample natural light, excellent ventilation, and abundant greenery. This is a landmark achievement as Dehradun's first-ever gold-rated green residential building. Experience opulent resort living with 100,000 sq. ft. of club and terrace facilities. The luxurious entrance lobby features a waterfall and tree courts, and residents can enjoy a multi-cuisine restaurant with private dining rooms, a spacious banquet hall, a cascade pool, an infinity pool on the terrace, a luxury spa retreat, private screening rooms, an open-air theatre, a gym, a jacuzzi, gaming rooms, an arcade zone, a library, and more.</p>
			  
			   <div class="col-md-12 margin-10px-top text-center">
            <a data-toggle="modal" data-target="#myModal" target="_blank" href="#" class="btn btn-large btn-rounded btn-deep-pink bg-deep-pink margin-25px-bottom "><i class="fa fa-phone"></i> Get a Callback</a>
          </div>
			  
</div>
       
           
          
      </div>
    </section>
	  
	 <section class="wow no-padding-tb fadeIn no-padding-top  " style="background-image:url('images/pattern-bg.png');">
<div class="container-fluid">
