    <section id="about" class="wow no-margin fadeIn">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="row text-center">
          <div class="col-md-12 center-col col-sm-12 col-xs-12">
            <img class="margin-10px-bottom" src="images/favicon.png" alt="excentia tatva rajpur road">
            <h1 class="letter-spacing-5 text-large display-block alt-font text-uppercase no-margin-bottom">Excentia TATVA dehradun</h1>    
            <h5 class="margin-20px-tb letter-spacing-minus-1 xs-margin-10px-top xs-no-margin-bottom title-large text-uppercase font-weight-800 text-blue">Elevate Your Lifestyle in<br>Dehradun's Jewel</h5>
              
              <p class="large padding-20px-lr margin-20px-bottom">This project is built around a historic tree courtyard featuring a well-preserved 200-year-old tree that once provided solace to Saint Maa Anandmayi during her meditations. Discover tranquility in this ancient tree courtyard, rejuvenate on the open-to-sky yoga deck, and experience holistic wellness in the healing garden on the terrace, complete with a reflexology path.</p>
                   <p class="large padding-20px-lr margin-50px-bottom">
Flat specifications include imported marble in common areas, laminated wooden flooring, VRV air conditioning, premium modular kitchens and wardrobes, and balconies up to 9 ft. wide offering splendid views.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        
      </div>
