            <p>A well-designed floor layout optimizes space, enhances functionality, and ensures a seamless flow. It typically features an open floor plan that integrates living, dining, and kitchen areas, promoting social interaction. Bedrooms and private spaces are strategically placed for privacy, while storage solutions, natural light, and ventilation are incorporated to create a balanced and harmonious living environment.</p>
