            <h3 class="text-black font-weight-700 margin-20px-bottom">About Excentia Infra</h3>
            <p class="">We are a leading real estate development firm based in Delhi NCR, in operation since 1986. Our operation spans across three North Indian cities that include Noida (Uttar Pradesh), Kota (Rajasthan) and Dehradun (Uttarakhand). We have delivered more than 7 lakh Sq. Ft. of Residential & Retail Spaces in the last 2 years and more than 3.5 Million Sq. Ft. of IT/ITES, Retail and Residential spaces is currently under development. Our Recently delivered project in Dehradun includes Infinity Greens located on Mussoorie Road. </p>
              
<p class="">At Excentia Infra, we take pride in our uncompromising integrity in customer engagement and providing market leading service and quality assurance. Our world-class design, excellent execution, differentiated branding and marketing, coupled with efficient and enthusiastic on-ground sales staff, work well together to create the best value for our customers. 

